        <p class="cta-note">✅ Solo 5 cupos disponibles este mes</p>
      </div>

      <div class="trust-badges">
        <div class="trust-badge"><span class="badge-icon">⚡</span><span>Entrega en 15 días</span></div>
        <div class="trust-badge"><span class="badge-icon">🛡️</span><span>Garantía 100%</span></div>
        <div class="trust-badge"><span class="badge-icon">💳</span><span>Pago en cuotas</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICIO -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="h2-section">¿Qué Incluye Tu Ecommerce Premium Completo?</h2>
